WEBVTT

NOTE
Reactivation of the Dollet communication tower — interior machinery starts up and the antenna deploys.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 14 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:03.900
Inside the Dollet tower — pipes, scaffolding and green-lit machinery.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.900
Large turbines and gears spin up inside the tower.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.900
The camera rises through the tower's tall internal shaft.

00:52.000 --> 00:57.200
At the top, the antenna apparatus extends outward against the dusk sky.

01:04.000 --> 01:07.900
The antenna array deploys fully, gleaming against the sunset.

01:12.000 --> 01:13.740
A signal beams skyward over the sea.
